# Expo (EAS) uploads the whole git repository for an iPhone build. Only the
# app in mobile/ is needed, so everything else (the website, its media and
# dependencies) is left out. This file replaces .gitignore for EAS uploads.
/*
!/mobile
!/.easignore

/mobile/node_modules
/mobile/ios
/mobile/android
/mobile/.expo
/mobile/dist
.env*
*.p8
*.p12
*.pem
.DS_Store
